==English==
[[File:Holzzahnstocher.jpg|thumb|Photograph of a container full of wooden '''toothpicks'''.]]

===Etymology===
From {{compound|en|tooth|pick}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/tuːθ.pɪk/}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A small, usually [[wooden]], [[stick]], often [[pointed]] at both ends, for removing [[food]] [[residue]] from between the [[teeth]].

====Synonyms====
* {{l|en|dentiscalp}}, {{l|en|picktooth}} {{qualifier|obsolete}}

